OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACan a photo capture London's
OL,4,Acultural appetite?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA world food photography competition,
OL,7,Fwhich last year had nearly 9,000
OL,8,Fentries from more than 50 countries,
OL,9,Fhas added a new category to capture the
OL,10,Fdiversity of London's culinary
OL,11,Fdelights.
OL,13,FOrganisers said they hoped images would
OL,14,Fbe shared "which tell stories of how
OL,15,Fthe city feeds itself - from
OL,16,FMichelin-star restaurants to street
OL,17,Fmarkets, corner shops, delis, delivery
OL,18,Fbikes and soup kitchens."
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
