OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACan a photo capture London's
OL,4,Acultural appetite?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 'London Museum London Taste'
OL,7,Fcategory of the World Food Photography
OL,8,FAwards is open to both amateur and
OL,9,Fprofessional photographers, wherever
OL,10,Fthey live.
OL,12,FThe launch comes as London Museum
OL,13,Fprepares to open its new home in
OL,14,FSmithfield on 28 November, which has
OL,15,Fbeen central to London's food history.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
